1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:08,550
The United Nations says that in some African countries, most people with albinism die of skin cancer between thirty and forty.

2
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:11,690
And every new city does something new to your skin:

3
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:13,960
the sun, the heat, the dry plane air.

4
00:00:14,410 --> 00:00:15,740
So I built Parasol:

5
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:20,640
a day-by-day skin forecast for every skin, from albinism to deep skin.

6
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:22,570
One selfie, any trip.

7
00:00:22,570 --> 00:00:26,150
Scan your own face, or try the demo with no selfie.

8
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:29,880
The demo faces are AI-generated, and the app says so.

9
00:00:30,330 --> 00:00:31,140
This is Sam.

10
00:00:31,140 --> 00:00:33,560
She has albinism and very fair skin.

11
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:37,530
YouCam reads her skin type, zone by zone, and her sun type.

12
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:39,550
On her face it read type five.

13
00:00:39,550 --> 00:00:46,290
Parasol shows that honestly, then uses type one, the most careful setting, because she has albinism.

14
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:47,520
Now the trip:

15
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:51,770
Cairo, then Dubai, then Reykjavik, with the real weather for every day.

16
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:54,920
Each day gets a forecast for Sam's skin:

17
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:57,350
heat, humidity, cold, dry cabin air.

18
00:00:57,350 --> 00:00:58,490
And a burn clock:

19
00:00:58,490 --> 00:01:02,000
about how many minutes before she may start to burn.

20
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,760
Always an estimate, never medical advice.

21
00:01:05,210 --> 00:01:06,160
Then her kit.

22
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:11,460
Thirty-two real products, from brands like Elta MD, CeraVe and Supergoop.

23
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,860
Every pick says why it's for her:

24
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:16,840
SPF fifty, fragrance-free, carry-on size.

25
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:19,090
Then the sun protection extras:

26
00:01:19,090 --> 00:01:22,510
a hat, sleeves, and UV four hundred sunglasses.

27
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:28,310
Checkout runs on a real Shopify store, with a test payment, so no real money moves.

28
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:30,540
Now Ada, day three in Dubai.

29
00:01:30,540 --> 00:01:33,960
Her skin feels different, so she rescans in the hotel.

30
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:37,200
Her acne score is twelve points worse than at home.

31
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:41,130
The likely cause comes from the real weather since she landed:

32
00:01:41,130 --> 00:01:41,830
muggy heat.

33
00:01:41,830 --> 00:01:45,250
Then what to do tonight, and when to see a pharmacist.

34
00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:49,520
Every morning, Today gives the routine for today's weather.

35
00:01:49,520 --> 00:01:53,870
Tap I'm going out, and a sun timer counts down to the next reapply.

36
00:01:53,870 --> 00:01:55,620
Read aloud speaks the page.

37
00:01:55,620 --> 00:02:04,430
Low-vision mode makes the text big, with strong contrast or a gentle dark theme, because many people with albinism also have low vision.

38
00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:06,350
Ada has very deep skin.

39
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:09,040
Parasol never tells her to skip sunscreen.

40
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:16,340
Her advice is about dark marks the sun can leave for months, and her kit puts sunscreens with no white cast first.

41
00:02:16,790 --> 00:02:18,760
Parasol is free for travellers.

42
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:26,020
It earns a commission on each trip kit, and from hotels, airlines and pharmacies that offer it to their customers.

43
00:02:26,020 --> 00:02:27,990
Albinism charities get it free.

44
00:02:28,440 --> 00:02:30,520
Under it all is the YouCam API:

45
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:39,600
AI Skin Analysis, the Fitzpatrick Scale Analyzer, Skin Simulation for Ada's day three photo, and AI Image Generator for the demo faces.

46
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:43,440
YouCam already works with more than eight hundred brands.

47
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:47,410
Parasol helps them sell sun care to both ends of the scale.

48
00:02:47,860 --> 00:02:48,450
Parasol.

49
00:02:48,450 --> 00:02:50,150
Your skin, on the road.

50
00:02:50,150 --> 00:02:53,680
Try it at parasol-topaz.vercel.app.
